{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":false,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":false,"protected_values":false,"translated":true},"context":"amerikaner-card-game UI copy.details","detected_language":"zh","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"amerikaner-card-game.copy.details","keys":["amerikaner-card-game.copy.details"],"locale":"zh-CN","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"这个本地版本遵循挪威的美国人规则,并与挪威的卡牌游戏进行了比较。 它支持3到6个玩家,使用标准的牌组,没有小丑。 为了平均分配牌,一、两或四张2将被留给3、5或6个玩家;4个玩家使用所有的ZXQPH0000QXZ牌。 庄家左边的玩家首先下注。 正常下注必须至少是您手牌的一半,并且高于当前的下注;您也可以过牌或跟注美国人,单独尝试每个招式,而无需配对或王牌。 如果您赢得正常下注,领先第一张牌设置王牌,并要求在您手中没有的那种花色的牌。 其持有者必须在第一个招式中玩它,并成为您的配对。 如果对手手中没有相同的牌,则继续无配对;只有宣布者作为出注者获得分数。 玩家","record_id":"74e420261964691c4479e64e1f6c85ff4da29fcb87622d5d020b61f740f0674a","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":6.348456389500029,"source":"This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"40ea37c675154fede4e50d8929d493265a637c4a89c7821fd0dac57879caea3a","status":"needs-review","translation":"这个本地版本遵循挪威的美国人规则,并与挪威的卡牌游戏进行了比较。 它支持3到6个玩家,使用标准的牌组,没有小丑。 为了平均分配牌,一、两或四张2将被留给3、5或6个玩家;4个玩家使用所有的ZXQPH0000QXZ牌。 庄家左边的玩家首先下注。 正常下注必须至少是您手牌的一半,并且高于当前的下注;您也可以过牌或跟注美国人,单独尝试每个招式,而无需配对或王牌。 如果您赢得正常下注,领先第一张牌设置王牌,并要求在您手中没有的那种花色的牌。 其持有者必须在第一个招式中玩它,并成为您的配对。 如果对手手中没有相同的牌,则继续无配对;只有宣布者作为出注者获得分数。 玩家","truncated":true,"warnings":["length_ratio"]}
